  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.035295689955856         -0.9604           -22.15           -92.67
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.009316859641498          0.2535             5.85            24.46
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Correlation:        -0.006686786587583         -0.1820            -4.20           -17.56
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
  Total Pauli Repulsion:                 0.039011746380112          1.0616            24.48           102.43
 (Total Pauli Repulsion =
  Delta E^Pauli in BB paper)

